{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":13.6},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.88,"end":27.12},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.52,"end":40.4}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2,"text":"蒸發讓溶劑進入氣相，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":2.32,"end":4.16,"text":"可能留下不揮發的溶質。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.64,"end":6.12,"text":"它沒有消滅溶劑；"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.32,"end":7.6,"text":"沒有冷凝器時，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.68,"end":9.76,"text":"也不會收集純化液態水。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.24,"end":13.6,"text":"要判斷沒有收集液體是否影響目標。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":14.88,"end":16.48,"text":"過濾後啟用蒸發，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":16.88,"end":20.08,"text":"比較剩餘溶質與移出的溶劑，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":20.32,"end":22.56,"text":"辨認真正收集到的產物。"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":23.8,"end":25.04,"text":"在此模型中，"},{"sectionId":"experiment","start":25.16,"end":27.12,"text":"單靠蒸發能回收什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":28.52,"end":29.76,"text":"在此模型中，"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":29.84,"end":31.84,"text":"單靠蒸發能回收什麼？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":33.12,"end":37.2,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.76,"end":40.4,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}